ds, but the scoping is explicit enough.\n\nOwn-run interpretation: The verdict line was INCONCLUSIVE (exit 2), and the answer matches it. It says the gate can neither show non-inferiority nor claim a regression, that the sample is too small, that this does not mean v2 is safe, and that arci plan is the way to size a larger run.",
